    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21576" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illūnis</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inl-</span></b> ), e, adj.
		in-luna, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>moonless</i>, <i>without
			moonlight</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nox,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. Ep. 6, 20, 14</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sil. 15, 619</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Amm. 17, 2, 3</span></i>.—Also,
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illūnĭus</span></b> , a, um: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">noctis illunio tempore,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 4, p. 150, 29</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tenebris illuniae caliginis impeditus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 9</span></i>
			, p. 232, 18.</div>
